====================================================
  Harness Curator — schedule installer
====================================================

Target OS:  Linux
Curator:    <SCRIPTS>/curate
Logfile:    <HOME>/.local/state/crewrig/harness-curator.log

# <HOME>/.config/systemd/user/io.crewrig.harness-curator.service
[Unit]
Description=CrewRig scheduled job io.crewrig.harness-curator

[Service]
Type=oneshot
Environment="PATH=<SANDBOX>/bin"
ExecStart=<NODE> <SCRIPTS>/curate --apply --dedup --max-issues 5
StandardOutput=append:<HOME>/.local/state/crewrig/harness-curator.log
StandardError=append:<HOME>/.local/state/crewrig/harness-curator.log
# <HOME>/.config/systemd/user/io.crewrig.harness-curator.timer
[Unit]
Description=CrewRig schedule of io.crewrig.harness-curator (weekly)

[Timer]
OnCalendar=Mon *-*-* 09:00:00
Persistent=false

[Install]
WantedBy=timers.target

Reactive trigger (run manually when a severity:high friction is filed):
    node <SCRIPTS>/curate --apply --dedup --max-issues 5
